  {
    title: "How would you design ad click event aggregation?",
    answer:
      "## Design Ad Click Event Aggregation\n\nCount `clicks/impressions` per `ad` per `minute` for billing, `late events` handled.\n\n| Layer | Tech |\n|---|---|\n| Ingest | `Kafka` `ad_clicks` `100K/s` |\n| Window | `Flink` `tumble 1m` `event-time` + `watermark 30s` + `allowed lateness 1m` |\n| Store | `ClickHouse` `AggregatingMergeTree` |\n| Dedup | `idempotency key` `ad+user+timestamp` `Bloom` |\n\n**Interview tip:** mention `exactly-once` via `idempotent consumer`.",
